    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_0"><bpmn:text>A_Submitted if
New credit and amount &gt; 4,500</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_0" sourceRef="ann_0" targetRef="idf0996c08-0392-4d35-b0fa-86fad481c1a9" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_1"><bpmn:text>A_Validating if CreditScore &gt; 566.5,
or no score and not New credit</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_1" sourceRef="ann_1" targetRef="id006d2bcd-61e8-4411-b757-166adaa748ea" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_2"><bpmn:text>another offer round if
CreditScore &lt;= 566.5 and not Limit raise</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_2" sourceRef="ann_2" targetRef="idc38d5902-19fe-4bc1-8ecb-aaab6d85df3d" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_3"><bpmn:text>A_Cancelled if
CreditScore &lt;= 296 and not Limit raise</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_3" sourceRef="ann_3" targetRef="id8de798ab-6b7d-42d7-929a-f688e62bdbc9" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_4"><bpmn:text>W_Call after offers if
LoanGoal is Unknown or Not specified</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_4" sourceRef="ann_4" targetRef="id080213d0-c179-4a5a-b977-333f0487ab5a" /><bpmn:textAnnotation id="ann_5"><bpmn:text>O_Accepted if CreditScore &gt; 296;
A_Denied if no score, New credit
and OfferedAmount &lt;= 13,450</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation><bpmn:association id="assoc_5" sourceRef="ann_5" targetRef="idead5417f-e4f6-40ee-9e3f-536faf989976" /></bpmn:process>
